{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgAsUsEfFzxYxmLVVnKgX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Google flags the note pages as Soft 404 because `robots.txt` has blocked your API since the `Disallow: /v1/` rule went in on 2026-09-07. I've fixed `robots.txt`, hardened `app.js`, and written the cause and fix in `ANSWER.md`.\n\n**Why:** Every note page is the same empty HTML shell, and `app.js` fills it in by fetching `/v1/notes/<slug>`. Googlebot follows `robots.txt` while it renders the page too, so that fetch is blocked. When the fetch fails, the app shows \"NOT FOUND – No note lives at this address\" but still returns HTTP 200, and Google treats that as a Soft 404. The URL Inspection export shows exactly that text as the rendered page. Browsers and curl don't obey `robots.txt`, so the pages look fine to you. The dates line up: the two notes last crawled in late August are still indexed, and every note crawled after Sep 7 is a Soft 404.\n\n**What I changed:**\n- **`site/robots.txt`:** added `Allow: /v1/notes` so the public read endpoints can be fetched again. I also added `Disallow: /v1/notes/*/reactions` and kept `Disallow: /v1/` and `/admin/`. Google uses the longest matching rule, so reactions, `/v1/me`, drafts and auth stay blocked. I checked this with a small script that applies the rules the way Google does: the public read paths are allowed and everything else is blocked.\n- **`site/app.js`:** only a real 404 from the API now shows \"NOT FOUND\", and it also sets the page to `noindex`. Any other failure (blocked, network, 5xx) shows a neutral \"Couldn't load this page\" message, so a temporary problem no longer looks like a missing page.\n\nNothing has been deployed or submitted. Once you deploy, ask Search Console to recrawl `robots.txt`, then run a live test on `/n/drip-line-pressure` and request indexing for the four Soft 404 URLs. Those steps are in `ANSWER.md`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1332,"cache_read_input_tokens":26243,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1332},"output_tokens":691,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c01326da-4372-4244-a8c0-d5d840b000c0","uuid":"8c2986ed-153a-4032-8429-2b3130e8e512","timestamp":"2026-10-19T03:17:21.572Z","request_id":"req_011CgAsUrz2MP1ZhaPBDKWex"}
